    "summary": "A couple, a pine forest and one slow afternoon. No posing, just a long walk.",
    "story": "<p>They asked for somewhere that felt like them, so we skipped the viewpoint and walked into the trees. The forest did the rest: soft light, long lines, and enough quiet that they forgot I was there.</p><p>We stayed until the sun dropped behind the ridge, and most of what's here came from the last half hour.</p>",
